    "description": "Mean cropland probability for 2024\u20132025, derived from Google Dynamic World (GOOGLE/DYNAMICWORLD/V1). Dynamic World provides near real-time 10 m land-cover probabilities from Sentinel-2; this layer is the temporal mean of the `crops` band over the period 2024-01-01 to 2025-12-31 for the Bugoma / LEON-P6 AOI. Pixel values are probabilities in [0, 1]. Users typically apply a threshold (e.g. > 0.1) to identify cropland for KPI analysis of forest-to-crop conversion.",
